# 本项目在 Windows 宿主机开发、在 Linux 开发容器内运行，统一以 LF 入库并检出，
# 避免换行符差异造成的伪 diff 与容器内脚本执行异常。
* text=auto eol=lf

# 二进制文件不做换行符转换
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.pdf binary
*.xlsx binary
*.xls binary
*.zip binary
*.gz binary

# 仅在 Windows 上执行的脚本必须保留 CRLF
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.cmd text eol=crlf
*.ps1 text eol=crlf
